* tb_adc4_points.cir -- R1 ADC revision 4 (D18): both slices, one held differential input per frame and slice.
* Frame s: slice A samples vda (SIN path) at tsA = 0.6 us + s * 22 T, slice B samples vdb (COS path) at tsA + N T.
* vda/vdb are PWL sources written by sim/r4/run_points4.py (value of frame s applied 550 ns before its edge).
* Inputs are linear E sources around the common mode CM (R2-7: no B sources on the input path).
* Reference: REFLINES (ideal sources, or r1_refbuf4 from an ideal 1.045 V bandgap node; vrefl = LSB-array reference).
* Substitutions: CORNER TEMP VDD CM CORE TIMING OPTS TMAX TSTOP PWLA PWLB REFLINES SAVE RAW
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib mos_ff
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerCAP.lib cap_typ
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOShv.lib mos_ff
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerRES.lib res_typ
.include schematic/r1_adc_r4.spice
.include sim/r4/r1_adc_timing_r4_n0_vdd132.inc
.temp -40
.option reltol=1e-4 vntol=1e-6 abstol=1e-12 gmin=1e-9 method=trap klu rshunt=1e12

Vdd vdd 0 1.32
Vdda vdda 0 3.3
Vbg vbg 0 1.045
XREF vbg vref vdda 0 r1_refbuf4 
Vrl vrefl vref 0
Vcm vcm 0 0.6
Vda vda 0 PWL(0 0.0000000 7.833333e-07 0.0000000 7.933333e-07 0.8800000 1.516667e-06 0.8800000 1.526667e-06 -0.8800000 2.250000e-06 -0.8800000 2.260000e-06 0.4400000 2.983333e-06 0.4400000
+ 2.993333e-06 -0.4400000 3.716667e-06 -0.4400000 3.726667e-06 0.0003000 4.450000e-06 0.0003000 4.460000e-06 0.8700000 5.183333e-06 0.8700000 5.193333e-06 -0.8700000 5.916667e-06 -0.8700000
+ 5.926667e-06 0.8800000 6.650000e-06 0.8800000 6.660000e-06 -0.8800000)
Vdb vdb 0 PWL(0 0.0000000 7.833333e-07 0.0000000 7.933333e-07 0.8800000 1.516667e-06 0.8800000 1.526667e-06 -0.8800000 2.250000e-06 -0.8800000 2.260000e-06 -0.4400000 2.983333e-06 -0.4400000
+ 2.993333e-06 0.4400000 3.716667e-06 0.4400000 3.726667e-06 -0.0003000 4.450000e-06 -0.0003000 4.460000e-06 -0.8700000 5.183333e-06 -0.8700000 5.193333e-06 0.8700000 5.916667e-06 0.8700000
+ 5.926667e-06 -0.8800000 6.650000e-06 -0.8800000 6.660000e-06 0.8800000)
Esp sinp vcm vda 0 0.5
Esn sinn vcm vda 0 -0.5
Ecp cosp vcm vdb 0 0.5
Ecn cosn vcm vdb 0 -0.5
Vip isap 0 0.6
Vin isan 0 0.6

XADC sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isap isan trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 clk30 wina winb lata latb
+ stba0 stba1 stba2 stba3 stba4 stba5 stba6 stba7 stba8 stba9 stba10 stba11 stba12 stba13
+ stbb0 stbb1 stbb2 stbb3 stbb4 stbb5 stbb6 stbb7 stbb8 stbb9 stbb10 stbb11 stbb12 stbb13
+ rawa rawb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vref vrefl 0 r1_adc4_core_fast

.control
set num_threads=1
save v(rawa) v(rawb) v(vref) v(vrefl) v(topap) v(topan) v(topbp) v(topbn) i(vdd) v(clk30) v(trka0) v(trkb0) i(vdda)
tran 1n 7.7267u 0 0.2n
meas tran idd avg i(vdd) from=0.7u to=7.7267u
write <G1_RESULTS_ROOT>/r1_adc/r4-refc-ffm40-buf/codes.raw
.endc
.end
